{
  "summary": "Added `stuckReported` flag to WatchdogTask to prevent duplicate TASK_STUCK events and log spam when a task remains stuck across multiple watchdog check cycles.",
  "learnings": [
    {
      "topic": "State management",
      "reminder": "When adding a flag to prevent duplicate events, consider when it should be reset (e.g., on task recovery, heartbeat update, or re-track)"
